  <main_text>
    <l n="1">qui colunt deos perigrinos vel fter-coreos.</l>
    <l n="2" para="true">Eft : ut ædificent tabernacu-lum.</l>
    <l n="3" para="true">Non debes tollere veétes arcæ exannulis fuis vel foraminibus.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">Sacerdotes parent panem pro-positionis &amp; Thus.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Ut parent candelas &amp; lucer-nas fingulis diebus. Obfervatur in fynagogis in memoriam templi.</l>
    <l n="6" para="true">Ut facerdotes in fungendo of-ficio induant fe veftibus facerdota-libus.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">Ne feparetur pectorale ab E-phod. i. humerali.</l>
    <l n="8" para="true">Ne laceretur illa tunica fupe-rior,</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">Edant illam carnem quæ fa-crificium eft pro peccatis.</l>
    <l n="10" para="true">Non debet alienus edere carnem ex fancto fanctorum.</l>
    <l n="11" para="true">Ut suffitum faciat sacerdos bis in die.</l>
    <l n="12" para="true">Non debes suffitum facere lu-per altare aureum suffumigatione aliena.</l>
    <l n="13" type="foot" para="true">Ff 5 &amp;nbsp; 192 U-</l>
  </main_text>
